### This is an example in plaintext, if you want runnable examples check ../raw-elal ###

### Explanation:
31A1: Header
00: Separator
11 48 69 2C 20 77 68 61 74 27 73 20 79 6F 75 72 20 6E 61 6D 65 3F 20 3A 20: Print 48 69 2C 20 77 68 61 74 27 73 20 79 6F 75 72 20 6E 61 6D 65 3F 20 3A 20 which is "Hi, what's your name? :" in ASCII
00: Separator
12 E0: Take user input and put it in E0
00: Separator
11 48 69 20: Print ASCII for "Hi "
01: Tell print that this value should be displayed without a trailing newline
11 E0 FD: Print E0 (the value previously given by the user)
01: Tell print that this value should be displayed without a trailing newline
11 2C 20 49 27 6D 20 45 4C 41 4C 21: Print ASCII for ", I'm ELAL!"
00: Separator
FF: EOF
